        "ContentType": "stories",
        "Topic": "Gia \u0111\u00ECnh",
        "SourceType": "original-20261114",
        "PreviewText": "C\u00E2u chuy\u1EC7n sinh nh\u1EADt v\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t s\u1EF1 c\u1ED1 v\u00E0 c\u00E1ch gi\u1EA3i quy\u1EBFt vui v\u1EBB.",
        "IsPublished": true
